SOAPBOX: A wonderful contest, an unmissable event, a fantastic return, and a lot
SOAPBOX: of fun. The bands were super crowded, but it's a shame I only had to
SOAPBOX: compete on one band and with limited time due to a limited setup. Despite
SOAPBOX: this, I managed to log unimaginable stations and finally, unexpectedly,
SOAPBOX: complete the WAS award with the last missing status (ID). A modest setup,
SOAPBOX: but superlative fun and happiness. See you next time, hoping to be much
SOAPBOX: more competitive. Thanks to all the stations who had the patience to log
SOAPBOX: me. 73' by IZ8GUQ Giovanni
